 character!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique style by using different designs and models to become the coolest Crazy Cart driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078860/extras/7f8e2e1a0e178b580da21f1da068119d.poster.avif?t=1759431795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078860/extras/7f8e2e1a0e178b580da21f1da068119d.webm?t=1759431795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078860/extras/7f8e2e1a0e178b580da21f1da068119d.mp4?t=1759431795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Beaked Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3884390","name":"Drift Gang"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078860/45b50d45526b67a1c666829ddb3dc958b9e56081/header.jpg?t=1759431795","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078860/1436884268/6ecc549ebf207cb6a587c045f429971b9da4c70d/1759341433/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759412471","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078860/1436884268/6ecc549ebf207cb6a587c045f429971b9da4c70d/1759341433/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759412471","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai